        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "2e725636-8e0b-350a-896a-c009752b3f5f",
                "word": "repentance",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8ec9c4d2-641e-48ff-b366-18ec7f92451f",
                        "entry_id": "2e725636-8e0b-350a-896a-c009752b3f5f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "repentances"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4e4e94e5-941a-32a3-a921-0b2a94f970f3",
                        "entry_id": "2e725636-8e0b-350a-896a-c009752b3f5f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Regret, douleur qu’on a de ses péchés."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4914e08c-d375-443d-b450-24414982d074",
                                "sense_id": "4e4e94e5-941a-32a3-a921-0b2a94f970f3",
                                "text": "Il est mort avec beaucoup de repentance, avec une grande repentance de ses péchés. Note : Ne s’emploie guère que dans le langage de la piété."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "44271220-67be-4c21-9a6b-5f4a465e742f",
                                "sense_id": "4e4e94e5-941a-32a3-a921-0b2a94f970f3",
                                "text": "« Je suis au désespoir d’avoir encore manqué à la fidélité que je dois à Votre Majesté ; je la supplie très-humblement d’agréer que je lui en demande un million de pardons, avec un compliment de soumission et de repentance. »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a80a3c2-7e23-4fa7-9ea4-050596d13139",
                                "sense_id": "4e4e94e5-941a-32a3-a921-0b2a94f970f3",
                                "text": "… il meurt avec des repentances très-grandes de l'avoir si mal traitée, et lui dit : « Pour votre consolation et ôter votre tristesse, souvenez-vous comme je vous ai traitée. »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "325b5483-71ae-400b-81de-cffce9623459",
                                "sense_id": "4e4e94e5-941a-32a3-a921-0b2a94f970f3",
                                "text": "Une secte juive, comme par hasard, et qui ferait mieux, au bout du compte, après ses erreurs innombrables, ses crimes, ses persécutions, ses censures, de se dissoudre, au lieu d’exprimer une « repentance » qui ne convainc personne."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4959cfd-a475-459b-8142-28ab65bfd364",
                                "sense_id": "4e4e94e5-941a-32a3-a921-0b2a94f970f3",
                                "text": "Mais si vous acceptez ce renversement d'attitude, ce retournement, cette conversion (c'est le vrai sens du mot metanoïa des Évangiles improprement traduit par repentance) toute la vie est transformée."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "80030a6e-d12f-3d52-81b8-adedecaeb106",
                        "entry_id": "2e725636-8e0b-350a-896a-c009752b3f5f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "En droit, personne ou individu répondant aux dispositions légales ou réglementaires afférentes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc61658d-b9d1-4632-a646-443ba9afb6f9",
                                "sense_id": "80030a6e-d12f-3d52-81b8-adedecaeb106",
                                "text": "Un amendement sur la \"repentance\" des personnes détenant des faux pass et voulant se faire vacciner est également prévu."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e726c05d-666a-4709-904d-e933d79e0ae0",
                        "source_entry_id": "2e725636-8e0b-350a-896a-c009752b3f5f",
                        "target_lang_word": "Reue",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Reue",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd80fda7-d1f1-3efe-bf84-30e0d41c19c6",
                                        "entry_id": "ce319bfd-d95e-3ddd-9306-a0796cbdee30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bedauern über die eigene Tat, Selbstschuldbewusstsein"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "779f4f74-ea0c-4b9a-9c96-6d1cc1293ed3",
                                                "sense_id": "fd80fda7-d1f1-3efe-bf84-30e0d41c19c6",
                                                "text": "„Nur, ich hatte nichts zu bereuen, gar nichts, und ich würde also Reue heucheln müssen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85ee8b74-f222-484d-af86-8563007a5abe",
                                                "sense_id": "fd80fda7-d1f1-3efe-bf84-30e0d41c19c6",
                                                "text": "Voll Reue über seine Tat, entschuldigte er sich."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "034967b0-028b-419f-bde8-b45ed8f08d28",
                                                "sense_id": "fd80fda7-d1f1-3efe-bf84-30e0d41c19c6",
                                                "text": "„Reue überkam ihn.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30e7a599-362f-4f92-b5b1-ed0f84e82793",
                                                "sense_id": "fd80fda7-d1f1-3efe-bf84-30e0d41c19c6",
                                                "text": "„Die Augenblicke der Reue sind recht traurig.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ac254da-8682-48d0-a0ff-1f26e4dd9772",
                                                "sense_id": "fd80fda7-d1f1-3efe-bf84-30e0d41c19c6",
                                                "text": "„Die Reue war Tag und Nacht bei mir, bis meine Frau einen viel besseren Mann geheiratet hatte, als ich jemals war oder sein konnte, und ich wusste, dass sie glücklich war.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8662d0fa-0374-3ab1-b830-b7d9a20a7865",
                                        "entry_id": "ce319bfd-d95e-3ddd-9306-a0796cbdee30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein Milderungsgrund bei der Strafbemessung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Justiz"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3014f6ce-0226-472a-b277-d3e7029977ce",
                                                "sense_id": "8662d0fa-0374-3ab1-b830-b7d9a20a7865",
                                                "text": "Er zeigte tätige Reue, wodurch die Strafe gering ausfallen konnte."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "91fdb5e4-0019-481f-bca0-5fd6fd64a40b",
                        "source_entry_id": "2e725636-8e0b-350a-896a-c009752b3f5f",
                        "target_lang_word": "repentance",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "repentance",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81a0d973-6b97-3ee1-a9d3-cf2480e5b3a9",
                                        "entry_id": "16ef1bac-a5a2-3c04-9697-dd98732c4eac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being repentant, penitent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89775ded-8b5e-4c5c-9326-b1b858e12449",
                                                "sense_id": "81a0d973-6b97-3ee1-a9d3-cf2480e5b3a9",
                                                "text": "1678, Bunyan, The Pilgrim's Progress, second period\nGod hath denied me repentance. His words gives me no encouragement to believe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "521ebf6d-3993-3c95-8c26-243eac9b8320",
                                        "entry_id": "16ef1bac-a5a2-3c04-9697-dd98732c4eac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feeling of regret or remorse for doing wrong or sinning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02c9c09e-93ac-4a54-b6e1-825f7e274d68",
                                                "sense_id": "521ebf6d-3993-3c95-8c26-243eac9b8320",
                                                "text": "And here, shipmates, is true and faithful repentance; not clamorous for pardon, but grateful for punishment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "73f4ca23-84ea-4835-bd5a-ee56dae9925f",
                        "source_entry_id": "2e725636-8e0b-350a-896a-c009752b3f5f",
                        "target_lang_word": "remorse",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "remorse",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d88fa4b-782f-3de8-9c22-d489eb9965fd",
                                        "entry_id": "acfdd1de-fc66-3021-a5b9-024ef1652e86",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feeling of regret or sadness for doing wrong or sinning."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0cf6aa0-29ea-4b01-802d-460560933081",
                                                "sense_id": "9d88fa4b-782f-3de8-9c22-d489eb9965fd",
                                                "text": "In criminal proceedings, empirical studies have shown that remorse plays an important role in observers’ judgments of defendants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52c506e6-5887-42d1-85e0-333685865742",
                                                "sense_id": "9d88fa4b-782f-3de8-9c22-d489eb9965fd",
                                                "text": "Failure, disgrace, poverty, sorrow, despair, suffering, tears even, the broken words that come from lips in pain, remorse that makes one walk on thorns, conscience that condemns . . . —all these were things of which I was afraid."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c6b6773-1201-3138-a788-f3e53fdc1bcd",
                                        "entry_id": "acfdd1de-fc66-3021-a5b9-024ef1652e86",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sorrow; pity; compassion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78692bde-9082-4018-bd4d-301708dac57d",
                                                "sense_id": "9c6b6773-1201-3138-a788-f3e53fdc1bcd",
                                                "text": "This is the bloodiest shame,\nThe wildest savagery, the vilest stroke,\nThat ever wall-eyed wrath or staring rage\nPresented to the tears of soft remorse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "remorse",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc37f572-7862-3039-af51-af951338bb36",
                                        "entry_id": "38cd9d37-b1f0-3206-af4d-99f5b0efebc0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To experience remorse; to regret."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01a07b95-5dc8-4449-a293-72a1673798e5",
                                                "sense_id": "dc37f572-7862-3039-af51-af951338bb36",
                                                "text": "And if we look abroad, to take a view of men as they are, we shall find that they remorse in one place, for doing or omitting that which others, in another place, think they merit by."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38c14825-1560-4d23-9622-2cc0df0f27eb",
                                                "sense_id": "dc37f572-7862-3039-af51-af951338bb36",
                                                "text": "When they have accepted their advice and have some upleasant experience then they remorse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64e59efb-f8b0-4f1f-83cd-cf47de4382d7",
                                                "sense_id": "dc37f572-7862-3039-af51-af951338bb36",
                                                "text": "Then with godly sorrow they remorse with a humble heart, and they repent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "06340411-94a0-4d98-b48f-c449f6ba7ecb",
